\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Idaho mother and son charged with kidnapping over out-of-state  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Carter Sherman \par \uc2 571 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 November 2023\par 13:10 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Rachael and Kadyn Swainston accused of taking underage girl to Oregon for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  without her parents\u8217\'20\'19 knowledge\par \par \uc2 An Idaho mother and son have been charged with second-degree kidnapping for allegedly taking an underage girl across state lines for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  without her parents\u8217\'20\'19 knowledge.\par \par \uc2 Idaho police started investigating Kadyn Swainston and his mother, Rachael Swainston, after the girl\u8217\'20\'19s mother reported to police that her daughter had been sexually assaulted and taken to Oregon for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  earlier this year.\par \par \uc2 The girl, who was supposed to have been living with her father, had instead been living with the Swainstons for six months, according to court records obtained by the Guardian. She had been in a consensual sexual relationship with Kadyn Swainston since she was 15 and he was 17, and the relationship continued after he turned 18, the girl told police. She said she became pregnant around the time of Kadyn Swainston\u8217\'20\'19s 18th birthday.\par \par \uc2 The girl said that she was \u8220\'20\'1Chappy\u8221\'20\'1D to learn she was pregnant, but said Kadyn Swainston told her that he would not pay child support and that the relationship would be over if she gave birth, court records show. The girl also said that Rachael Swainston made the arrangements for the girl to have an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Rachael Swainston told the girl that Kadyn Swainston would get in trouble because he was over 18, and threatened to kick her out of the house if she revealed she was pregnant to her parents, police said.\par \par \uc2 The girl obtained an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Oregon in May, she said. Police used cellphone data to confirm that her phone, Kadyn\u8217\'20\'19s phone, and Rachael\u8217\'20\'19s phone traveled to Oregon together around the time of the procedure, court records show.\par \par \uc2 Idaho bans almost all abortions. The Swainstons have not been charged under Idaho\u8217\'20\'19s so-called \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  trafficking\u8221\'20\'1D statute, a first-of-its-kind law that penalizes people who take minors across state lines for abortions without their parents\u8217\'20\'19 consent. However, their charges are already being held up as a test case for the highly controversial statute, which is now at the center of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/jul/12/idaho-abortion-lawsuit-minors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  a lawsuit filed by \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  rights supporters.}}}\par \par \uc2 At least one anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  website has also covered the case as evidence of the need for laws that require minors to get their parents involved before having an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Eventually, the girl was told to leave the Swainstons\u8217\'20\'19 house, she told police.\par \par \uc2 During their investigation, police found sexually explicit video and photos of the girl and Kadyn Swainston \u8211\'20\'13 some of which were captured after Kadyn\u8217\'20\'19s 18th birthday, according to court records.\par \par \uc2 In addition to the kidnapping charge, Kadyn Swainston has been charged with rape and three counts of producing child sexually exploitative material. Kadyn Swainston told police he had sex with the girl, and that he and his mother took the girl to Oregon, where she obtained an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Rachael Swainston is also facing multiple drug charges. She told police she did take the girl to Oregon for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , according to court records. But Rachael Swainston said the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  was a mutual decision by Kadyn Swainston and the girl, and denied coercing the girl into the procedure.\par \par \uc2 Court records show both Swainstons have been assigned a local public defender. The public defender\u8217\'20\'19s office did not immediately return a request for comment.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020231101ejb1001xi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
