\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18He\u8217\'20\'19s pretty smooth\u8217\'20\'19: \uc2 Glenn Youngkin\uc2  of Virginia may be a challenger for Trump\b0\par\par\uc2 David Smith in Washington \par \uc2 1,840 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 October 2023\par 10:01 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Republican governor is anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , anti-trans and a \u8216\'20\'18nightmare\u8217\'20\'19 for Democrats\par \par \uc2 It looked, sounded and felt like the start of a US presidential campaign. \u8220\'20\'1CThe stakes are high and the consequences couldn\u8217\'20\'19t be greater,\u8221\'20\'1D said \uc2 Glenn Youngkin\uc2  in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W_x1seKBM9I"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a glossy video}}}\uc2  that showed the Virginia governor walking in \uc2 Ronald Reagan\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s footsteps at the 40th president\u8217\'20\'19s library in Simi Valley, California, complete with Air Force One and a fragment of the Berlin wall.\par \par \uc2 The ad, \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s Time to Usher in a New Era of American Values,\u8221\'20\'1D was released by Youngkin in May, fuelling speculation of a White House run that never came. With Republican candidates struggling to stop the \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  juggernaut, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.axios.com/2023/05/22/glenn-youngkin-us-president-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rumours that he could yet be drafted}}}\uc2  as the party establishment\u8217\'20\'19s alternative have not gone away. The make-or-break moment for Youngkin could come on 7 November when Virginia goes to the polls.\par \par \uc2 Every seat in the state\u8217\'20\'19s general assembly is on the ballot. Both parties see a path to a legislative majority in a state that has been trending Democratic. Should Republicans \u8211\'20\'13 with Youngkin\u8217\'20\'19s help on the campaign trail - manage to hold the house of delegates and flip the senate, donors may be unable to resist the conclusion that he has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/nov/03/republicans-critical-race-theory-winning-electoral-issue"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cracked the code}}}\uc2  for winning over suburban voters in swing states.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf he wins both houses, then it will take about 10 minutes for the national media to say we\u8217\'20\'19ve got a new challenger: \u8216\'20\'18\uc2 Glenn Youngkin\uc2 , the giant killer, and \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s never faced this before\u8217\'20\'19,\u8221\'20\'1D said {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://centerforpolitics.org/staff/larry-j-sabato/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Larry Sabato}}}\uc2 , the director of the center for politics at the \uc2 University of Virginia in Charlottesville\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CBut if he doesn\u8217\'20\'19t, if he loses even the state senate, the air will go out of this trial balloon very quickly.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Youngkin, who stands 6ft 5ins tall, cultivates the persona of a sunny suburban dad in his signature zippered red vest. He is not weighed down by the baggage of Trump\u8217\'20\'19s 91 criminal charges. At 56 years old, he would represent generational change on a debate stage with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/sep/12/joe-biden-age-polls-democrats-2024-election"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 80-year-old Joe Biden}}}\uc2 . Sabato acknowledged this, saying: \u8220\'20\'1CHe\u8217\'20\'19s a nightmare for the Biden people. He projects this image that even people in the press who know better can\u8217\'20\'19t help but swallow.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Youngkin was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.governor.virginia.gov/about/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 born in Richmond}}}\uc2 , the state capital that was also the capital of the confederacy during the civil war. When his father lost his job, the teenage Youngkin washed dishes to help support the family, who moved to Virginia Beach. He gained a basketball scholarship to \uc2 Rice University\uc2  in Houston, attended \uc2 Harvard Business School\uc2  and worked for blue-chip financial companies such as \uc2 McKinsey & Company\uc2  and the \uc2 Carlyle Group\uc2 . He and his wife, Suzanne, own a 31.5-acre property in Great Falls in northern Virginia.\par \par \uc2 He ran for governor as a political outsider in 2021 and his victory appeared to offer a \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/nov/06/republicans-glenn-youngkin-joe-biden-democrats"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trumpism without Trump}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D blueprint for Republicans struggling in purple states. Youngkin artfully kept the former president at arm\u8217\'20\'19s length without alienating him and, harnessing a conservative backlash against pandemic lockdowns, made \u8220\'20\'1Cparents\u8217\'20\'19 rights\u8221\'20\'1D his defining issue.\par \par \uc2 He repeatedly criticised public schools on \u8220\'20\'1Cculture war\u8221\'20\'1D issues such as transgender bathrooms and vowed: \u8220\'20\'1COn day one, I will ban critical race theory.\u8221\'20\'1D The fate of his opponent, \uc2 Terry McAuliffe\uc2 , was sealed when, during a debate, McAuliffe said: \u8220\'20\'1CI don\u8217\'20\'19t believe parents should be telling schools what they should teach\u8221\'20\'1D \u8211\'20\'13 a line that was constantly replayed in the Republican\u8217\'20\'19s attacks ads.\par \par \uc2 Youngkin claims that, as governor, he has passed the biggest education budget in Virginia\u8217\'20\'19s history, cut taxes, encouraged investment and boosted military veterans. He remains a hugely divisive figure. He endorsed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.axios.com/local/richmond/2023/10/03/virginia-abortion-ban-glenn-youngkin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a 15-week ban on \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  with exceptions for rape, incest and the life of the mother.\par \par \uc2 He is facing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.axios.com/2023/10/06/virginia-dems-demand-probe-expulsions-voting-rolls-youngkin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Democratic calls for a federal investigation}}}\uc2  into why an unknown number of people were wrongly purged from Virginia\u8217\'20\'19s voter rolls because they were mistakenly listed as felons, as well as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.vpm.org/2023-04-07/youngkins-felon-voting-rights-face-legal-challenges"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a legal challenge}}}\uc2  for slowing down the process in which former felons\u8217\'20\'19 voting rights may be restored.\par \par \uc2 He campaigned with election deniers such as Kari Lake of Arizona, calling her \u8220\'20\'1Cawesome\u8221\'20\'1D. He set up a \u8220\'20\'1Ctip line\u8221\'20\'1D for parents to report supposedly divisive practices in schools, only for it to be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.npr.org/2022/11/05/1134514204/a-tip-line-championed-by-virginia-gov-youngkin-last-year-has-been-quietly-shut-d#:~:text=GLENN%20YOUNGKIN%3A%20For%20parents%20to,of%20public%20reaction%20was%20there%3F"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 quietly shut down}}}\uc2 . When then House speaker \uc2 Nancy Pelosi\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s husband Paul was attacked with a hammer by an intruder in their San Francisco home, Youngkin condemned the violence only to then quip: \u8220\'20\'1CBut we\u8217\'20\'19re going to send her back to be with him in California.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Some of his early admirers have since recanted. In July last year, Karen Tumulty, an associate editor of the \uc2 Washington Post\uc2 , wrote a column entitled \u8220\'20\'1CWhy \uc2 Glenn Youngkin\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 or someone like him \u8211\'20\'13 must run in 2024.\u8221\'20\'1D Three months later, Tumulty {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/opinions/2022/10/29/youngkin-comments-pelosi-attack-dangerous-tasteless/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 followed up with}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m sorry I said nice things about \uc2 Glenn Youngkin\uc2 \u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/abhirahmantx?lang=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Abhi Rahman}}}\uc2 , the communications director of the Democratic Legislative Campaign Committee, said: \u8220\'20\'1C It\u8217\'20\'19s been an unmitigated disaster. If you were to ask anybody what are his accomplishments, they can\u8217\'20\'19t name anything. He hasn\u8217\'20\'19t done anything he said he would except for getting sued by school boards and trying to impose things on trans people. That\u8217\'20\'19s what he\u8217\'20\'19s spent his tenure doing while crime is getting worse in Virginia, education is getting worse, the economy is getting worse \u8211\'20\'13 all of that is happening under \uc2 Glenn Youngkin\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 He added: \u8220\'20\'1CIf this election is a referendum on \uc2 Glenn Youngkin\uc2 , I think we win. His approval rating is only in the 50s whereas, when you look at other governors across the country, theirs are usually in the 60s or even 70s. The more people know about what he\u8217\'20\'19s doing, the worse it gets for him. If he wins, he\u8217\'20\'19s going to do an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban and that is something Virginians definitely don\u8217\'20\'19t want.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Youngkin is not on the ballot next month but he has a significant personal investment in the outcome. He is appearing in an ad for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://link.axios.com/click/33108005.2945/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuZmFjZWJvb2suY29tL1JpbGV5Rm9yRGVsZWdhdGUvdmlkZW9zLzE3NTcyNzM3NDgwMzU3MjUvP3V0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zc25lYWtwZWVrJnN0cmVhbT10b3A/58c6e533a79328702e8b4bbfBa9e83b2a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Riley Shaia}}}\uc2 , a candidate for the state assembly in a suburban district of Richmond that leans Democratic. His political action committee, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://link.axios.com/click/33108005.2945/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cudnBhcC5vcmcvY29tbWl0dGVlcy8zNzQzMzMvc3Bpcml0LW9mLXZpcmdpbmlhLz91dG1fc291cmNlPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXImdXRtX21lZGl1bT1lbWFpbCZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bmV3c2xldHRlcl9heGlvc3NuZWFrcGVlayZzdHJlYW09dG9w/58c6e533a79328702e8b4bbfB28dc9249"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Spirit of Virginia}}}\uc2 , has raised almost $20m for Republican candidates in key battlegrounds.\par \par \uc2 The Democrat {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.briskmanforsupervisor.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Juli Briskman}}}\uc2 , a supervisor in Loudon county who represents the Algonquin district, said: \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s a critical year for Loudoun county and for the entire state because \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights, voting rights, healthcare in general are all on the chopping block.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Briskman, who is seeking re-election, is convinced that Youngkin would push for a national \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban if he swapped the governor\u8217\'20\'19s mansion for the White House. \u8220\'20\'1CHe\u8217\'20\'19s pretty smooth. That\u8217\'20\'19s how he got into the governor\u8217\'20\'19s office. But he has shown his true colours since he\u8217\'20\'19s been in here. He is just as Maga as Trump and I would feel just as horrible having him as president as I do having him as governor,\u8221\'20\'1D she said.\par \par \uc2 It is hard to discern whether Youngkin\u8217\'20\'19s anti-woke populism is a facade cultivated for reasons of electoral expediency or whether he has become a true believer. A prominent academic in Virginia, who did not wish to be named, said: \u8220\'20\'1CFor most of his life he\u8217\'20\'19s been no more or less bigoted than a country club conservative. But he\u8217\'20\'19s now involved in electoral politics, and the Republican party is the party of Trump.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CTo enact the kind of policies that are most important to him, he\u8217\'20\'19s convinced himself that things like \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and trans rights and critical race theory \u8211\'20\'13 things I\u8217\'20\'19m sure he has never given any thought to at all \u8211\'20\'13 suddenly have become important because they\u8217\'20\'19re so important for Republican electoral politics.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI don\u8217\'20\'19t know if he\u8217\'20\'19s playing a game. People do move, they shift, they change. \u8216\'20\'18I have this moment of epiphany that not only is it required that I become fiercely anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  to be a member of this Republican party but now I\u8217\'20\'19m believing it too.\u8217\'20\'19 The same thing over trans school kids and whatever they mean by critical race theory. We become what we pretend to be very often.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Youngkin answers questions about his presidential prospects by saying he is flattered to be in the conversation but focused on Virginia, where his single term as governor ends in 2026. He has travelled across the country, made frequent appearances on conservative media, broken fundraising records and this week hosted his second annual {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/dc-md-va/2023/10/16/youngkin-trump-pompeo-republican-retreat/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Red Vest Retreat in Virginia Beach}}}\uc2  for big-money donors.\par \par \uc2 Such data points have given weight to the theory that he has still not ruled out a late entry in the race for the White House in 2024. For anti-Trump forces, disappointed by the failure of the Florida governor \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2  to dislodge the former president\u8217\'20\'19s base, he would represent one last, desperate throw of the dice. Youngkin would face significant {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/glenn-youngkin-president-trump-2024-gop-91adf2b58e18f2d48da29c6219570537"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 logistical campaign difficulties}}}\uc2 , ballot-access hurdles and scepticism from Republican voters, many of whom appear immovably devoted to Trump.\par \par \uc2 With fewer than 100 days until voting starts with the Iowa caucuses, Youngkin does not have the kind of campaign organisation a presidential hopeful needs to recruit supporters or get voters to turn out. The deadline to file for the second contest, New Hampshire\u8217\'20\'19s primary, was 27 October, and other states\u8217\'20\'19 deadlines follow hard upon that. Some argue that Youngkin would be better advised to keep his powder dry for a potential post-Trump era in 2028.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://paullottfordelegate.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Paul Lott}}}\uc2 , a Republican candidate for the house of delegates from Ashburn, said: \u8220\'20\'1CGlenn doesn\u8217\'20\'19t do anything unless he sees a clear reason for it and he does not speculate ahead. Right now \u8211\'20\'13 and this is from a person that knows him personally \u8211\'20\'13 he\u8217\'20\'19s not thinking about it. He\u8217\'20\'19s trying to get done in Virginia what gets done in Virginia. We need to focus on our problems. We have a senate that we need to flip. We have a house that we need to maintain.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/RichAndersonRPV?ref_src=twsrc%5Egoogle%7Ctwcamp%5Eserp%7Ctwgr%5Eauthor"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Rich Anderson}}}\uc2 , the chair of the Republican party of Virginia, heaped praise on the governor but dismissed talk of a presidential bid at this late stage. \u8220\'20\'1CHe has the skill set to be chief executive of the United States just as I believe he\u8217\'20\'19s done very well \u8211\'20\'13 and a majority of Virginians feel he\u8217\'20\'19s done very well \u8211\'20\'13 as chief executive of Virginia,\u8221\'20\'1D he said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBut he is definitely focused solely on Virginia when he and I are together. I\u8217\'20\'19m not being cute or evasive about it. That\u8217\'20\'19s not an issue we discuss. We are focused on this year\u8217\'20\'19s election because the agenda that\u8217\'20\'19s important to him and to Virginia Republicans hinges on holding the house and flipping the senate, and that\u8217\'20\'19s taken all of our energy and attention and resources.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020231030ejau001jl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
