\par\par \uc2 World news\par \b \uc2 New York City public hospitals to offer  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  care via telehealth\b0\par\par\uc2 Gloria Oladipo in New York \par \uc2 480 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 October 2023\par 20:02 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Mayor Eric Adams announced on Monday that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill prescriptions would now be available by telephone or online\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/new-york"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 New York City}}}\uc2  public hospitals will now offer \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  care via telehealth, placing them among the first public health systems in the US to do so.\par \par \uc2 The city\u8217\'20\'19s mayor, Eric Adams, announced on Monday that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill prescriptions would now be available by telephone or online, adding that such access can happen from \u8220\'20\'1Cthe comfort of your home\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 As a result of the move, New York City residents will now be able to connect with health practitioners for those prescriptions, building on previous legislations to protect abortions rights in New York.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf you are clinically eligible, that provider will be able to prescribe \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  medication that would be delivered to your New York City address within days,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/NYCMayor/status/1708862010572657034?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Adams said}}}\uc2  during Monday\u8217\'20\'19s announcement.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe will not stand idly by as these attacks continue and the far-rights seeks to strip our citizens of their basic rights,\u8221\'20\'1D Adams added, referring to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions being legislated across the country.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights organizations celebrated Monday\u8217\'20\'19s announcement as an essential step to protect reproductive rights.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CToday marks a historic win for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access in New York City,\u8221\'20\'1D said Wendy Stark, president and CEO of Planned Parenthood of Greater New York.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhen we make \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  care more accessible, we empower individuals to make the best decisions for themselves, their families and their futures,\u8221\'20\'1D Stark added.\par \par \uc2 The expanded access to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  care comes after the supreme court\u8217\'20\'19s elimination last year of the federal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights established by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/roe-v-wade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Roe v Wade}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Since then, at least 20 states have passed restrictions on abortions, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2022/us/abortion-laws-roe-v-wade.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the New York Times reports}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Fourteen states, mainly in the south, have enacted total bans on the medical procedure.\par \par \uc2 US courts have also limited access to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  medication. In August, a US appeals court ruled that the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill mifepristone {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/aug/16/restriction-abortion-pill-mifepristone-access-fda-court-decision"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 should be regulated}}}\uc2  according to rules set prior to 2016.\par \par \uc2 In August 2022, Adams {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nyc.gov/office-of-the-mayor/news/591-22/mayor-adams-signs-legislation-guaranteeing-access-safe-affordable-abortion-new-york-city#/0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 signed legislation }}}\uc2  protecting the right to abortions in New York City after the supreme court\u8217\'20\'19s decision to overturn Roe v Wade.\par \par \uc2 The measures signed by Adams \u8211\'20\'13 six in total \u8211\'20\'13 also made \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  medication free at all of New York\u8217\'20\'19s department of health and mental hygiene clinics.\par \par \uc2 The New York state legislature has also passed legislation protecting medical professionals in the state who provide \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills to patients in places where the procedure is banned, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/2023/06/20/health/abortion-shield-law-new-york.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the New York Times reported}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Other Democratic-led cities and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.illinois.gov/news/press-release.25906.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 states}}}\uc2  have passed similar measures protecting reproductive rights.\par \par \uc2 In January, the governor of Illinois, JB Pritzker, signed legislation expanding \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access by allowing more practitioners to provide the medical procedure and mandating that agencies in the state cover the procedure, the television news outlet {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://news.wttw.com/2023/01/13/pritzker-signs-law-expanding-access-abortion-protecting-out-state-patients"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 WTTW reported}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020231002eja20030e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
