\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 From  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  to January 6: where each Republican candidate in the debate stands on big issues\b0\par\par\uc2 Mary Yang \par \uc2 1,341 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 September 2023\par 01:05 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Donald Trump again skipped the second debate of the 2024 primary season, as candidates vie to present policy agendas\par \par \uc2 Republicans vying for the 2024 party nomination were set to take the stage in Simi Valley, California , on Wednesday night for the second debate of the primary season.\par \par \uc2 The candidates will once again throw punches at each other and at Donald Trump, who has a significant lead in polls but is skipping the debate. But it\u8217\'20\'19s also a chance for each candidate to present their policy agenda and voice their stance on key voter issues such as \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and aid to Ukraine.\par \par \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s where each candidate in Wednesday\u8217\'20\'19s debate stands on issues such as \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , immigration, the economy and continued aid to Ukraine.\par \par \uc2 ***\par \par \uc2 Ron DeSantis\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 : DeSantis has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/florida-abortion-ban-approved-c9c53311a0b2426adc4b8d0b463edad1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 supported bills restricting access to \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 including a six-week ban in his own state of Florida \u8211\'20\'13 but has stopped short of saying he would support a federal ban.\par \par \uc2 Economy: In a recently released {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://rondesantis.com/mission/Declaration-of-economic-independence/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 economic plan}}}\uc2 , DeSantis said he would cut individual taxes and slash government spending. He also pushed for \u8220\'20\'1CAmerican energy independence\u8221\'20\'1D and a rollback of electric vehicles.\par \par \uc2 Immigration: As governor, DeSantis has enacted some of the country\u8217\'20\'19s strictest {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.flgov.com/2023/05/10/governor-ron-desantis-signs-strongest-anti-illegal-immigration-legislation-in-the-country-to-combat-bidens-border-crisis/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 laws against undocumented immigrants}}}\uc2 , including asking hospital patients to prove their legal status. He also made the controversial move to use public funds to send newly arrived migrants to Martha\u8217\'20\'19s Vineyard in a political stunt. As president, he said he would eliminate the visa lottery and limit \u8220\'20\'1Cunskilled immigration\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Foreign\par \par \uc2 policy: He opposes additional US involvement in Ukraine and has pledged to reduce economic ties with \u8220\'20\'1Ccommunist China\u8221\'20\'1D and said the US would no longer \u8220\'20\'1Ckowtow to Wall Street\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Jan\par \par \uc2 uary 6: DeSantis said it was \u8220\'20\'1Cunfortunate\u8221\'20\'1D but \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/ron-desantis-jan-6-insurrection-cdadb8e378179939549659cc8b23a643"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 not an insurrection}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 M\par \par \uc2 ore: The current governor of Florida and a former congressman was widely expected to be Trump\u8217\'20\'19s main primary challenger. But his favorability among Republicans has taken many hits, starting with a glitchy Twitter Spaces event hosted by \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 . He has frequently touted his opposition to gender-affirming care for trans people and other public health measures such as mask mandates.\par \par \uc2 ***\par \par \uc2 Vivek Ramaswamy\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 : Ramaswamy told a crowd at the Iowa State Fair he is \u8220\'20\'1Cunapologetically pro-life\u8221\'20\'1D. But his campaign earlier {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://time.com/6263960/abortion-ban-2024-republicans-campaign/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 confirmed}}}\uc2  he would not back a national \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban.\par \par \uc2 Economy: The biotech entrepreneur wants to \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/podcasts/opinion-potomac-watch/paul-gigot-interviews-vivek-ramaswamy-on-the-economy/c9495eda-6bdc-47d9-be67-335a232f6b8f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 unshackle}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D the energy sector, saying the US should abandon its climate goals to drive down energy costs and boost its GDP. He is also in favor of some corporate and individual tax cuts.\par \par \uc2 Immigration: Ramaswamy said he wants to deport \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/vivekgramaswamy_i-say-this-as-the-kid-of-immigrants-we-must-activity-7055709521695907840-g4jt/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 universally}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D and end birthright citizenship for children of undocumented immigrants, who would then be required to apply to become a citizen.\par \par \uc2 Foreign\par \par \uc2 policy: Ramaswamy has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o8xoE0qldKc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 criticized US aid to Ukraine}}}\uc2 , saying it is strengthening Russia\u8217\'20\'19s alliance with China.\par \par \uc2 Jan\par \par \uc2 uary 6: Ramaswamy condemned Trump the week after the January 6 attack but has walked back his criticism since then. Responding to a question for an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/aug/21/vivek-ramaswamy-conspiracy-theories-9-11-jan-6-republican-presidential-candidate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Atlantic profile}}}\uc2  about what truly happened that day, Ramaswamy said: \u8220\'20\'1CI don\u8217\'20\'19t know.\u8221\'20\'1D He has defended ex-president Trump across his four indictments.\par \par \uc2 M\par \par \uc2 ore: Time magazine labeled Ramaswamy a \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://time.com/6305440/vivek-ramaswamy-interview-republican-primary/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 breakout candidate}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D. The political outsider has steadily climbed the polls since launching his long-shot bid as an \u8220\'20\'1Canti-woke\u8221\'20\'1D patriot, and was a memorable part of the first debate.\par \par \uc2 ***\par \par \uc2 Tim Scott\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 : Scott, an evangelical Christian, is staunchly anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and said he would {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wmur.com/article/new-hampshire-tim-scott-abortion/44614260"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 support a national 15-week ban}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Economy: Scott {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/tim-scott-bets-personal-story-will-boost-long-shot-2024-white-house-bid-c172aeee"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 supports}}}\uc2  tax cuts and stronger economic competition with China. As a senator, Scott championed legislation establishing \u8220\'20\'1Copportunity zones\u8221\'20\'1D, which are meant to increase economic development in low-income areas by incentivizing private investment, though {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://nlihc.org/resource/gentrifying-opportunity-zones-are-more-likely-non-gentrifying-opportunity-zones-receive"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 critics say}}}\uc2  residents may not benefit from gentrification.\par \par \uc2 Immigration: He is in favor of a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehill.com/homenews/campaign/4137810-tim-scott-says-hed-finish-border-wall-if-elected-president/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wall along the US southern border}}}\uc2  to curb illegal migration and drug trafficking.\par \par \uc2 Foreign\par \par \uc2 policy: He broadly supports continued US aid to Ukraine and said Biden has not done enough. But some conservatives think he\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://foreignpolicy.com/2023/08/17/tim-scott-gop-presidential-republican-trump-china/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 soft on China}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Jan\par \par \uc2 uary 6: Scott said he doesn\u8217\'20\'19t believe the 2020 election was stolen and does not blame Trump for the violence at the Capitol.\par \par \uc2 M\par \par \uc2 ore: The South Carolina senator, who is the only Black Republican in the Senate, is an outspoken critic when it comes to teaching kids about race and gender in schools and has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/news/datablog/2021/may/06/tim-scott-america-racist-data-racial-disparities"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CAmerica is not a racist country.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 ***\par \par \uc2 Nikki Haley\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 : The only woman on the debate stage, Haley is anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  but has also called a federal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban \u8220\'20\'1Cunrealistic\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Economy: Haley {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.usatoday.com/story/opinion/2023/03/07/nikki-haley-national-debt-blame-democrats-republicans/11411148002/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote in an op-ed}}}\uc2  that she opposes raising the national debt limit and would \u8220\'20\'1Cveto spending bills that don\u8217\'20\'19t put America on track to reach pre-pandemic spending levels\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Foreign\par \par \uc2 policy: The former US ambassador to the United Nations under Trump, Haley has labeled the Chinese Communist party an \u8220\'20\'1Cenemy\u8221\'20\'1D and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2023/06/27/politics/nikki-haley-trump-china-record/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 criticized Trump}}}\uc2  for trying to befriend the Chinese president, Xi Jinping.\par \par \uc2 Immigration: Haley has vowed to tighten security at the US-Mexico border and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://nikkihaley.com/2023/04/06/2024-hopeful-nikki-haley-says-biden-doesnt-deserve-to-be-president-after-visiting-border-shame-on-you/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 add 25,000 patrol agents}}}\uc2 , as well as require companies to verify employees\u8217\'20\'19 status online \u8211\'20\'13 which she signed into law in South Carolina as governor.\par \par \uc2 Jan\par \par \uc2 uary 6: Haley has called January 6 a \u8220\'20\'1Cterrible day\u8221\'20\'1D and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/interactives/2021/magazine-nikki-haleys-choice/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  Trump \u8220\'20\'1Cwent down a path that he shouldn\u8217\'20\'19t have\u8221\'20\'1D in an interview with Politico.\par \par \uc2 ***\par \par \uc2 Chris Christie\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 : He has said he would not support a federal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban.\par \par \uc2 Economy: The former New Jersey governor has targeted \u8220\'20\'1Cexcessive government spending\u8221\'20\'1D as the reason for inflation and floated {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/06/20/chris-christie-floats-social-security-cuts-slams-trump.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cuts to social security}}}\uc2 , including Medicare.\par \par \uc2 Foreign\par \par \uc2 policy: Christie, who has aligned himself with the hawkish, tough-on-China-and-Russia camp, visited the Ukrainian president, \uc2 Volodymyr Zelenskiy\uc2 , in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2023/08/19/chris-christie-eyes-china-not-russia-as-americas-biggest-foreign-foe-00111960#:~:text=Speaking%20to%20Erick%20Erickson%20at,his%20administration%20would%20look%20like."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 surprise trip}}}\uc2  earlier this month to affirm his support for continued US aid.\par \par \uc2 Immigration: Christie {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/GovChristie/status/1656671377188085761"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cimmigrants are pouring over the border\u8221\'20\'1D in an attack against Trump\u8217\'20\'19s campaign promise to build a border wall.\par \par \uc2 Jan\par \par \uc2 uary 6: Christie, who was in the running to be Trump\u8217\'20\'19s VP after dropping out of the 2016 presidential race, is now Trump\u8217\'20\'19s loudest critic. He broke with Trump over the January 6 Capitol attack, calling Trump a \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehill.com/homenews/campaign/4140214-christie-says-trump-was-too-coward-on-jan-6-to-join-supporters-on-capitol-hill/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 coward}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D for not joining rioters.\par \par \uc2 ***\par \par \uc2 Mike Pence\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 : The former vice-president, an evangelical Christian, is the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/mike-pence-abortion-views-2024-election-e5b236c27bc9c86f77efedbeedb26520"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 loudest anti-\b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  candidate}}}\uc2  and has condemned his opponents for refusing to back a six-week \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban.\par \par \uc2 Economy: Pence has said his top priority is boosting the US economy and has called on the Fed to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2023/06/26/economy/fed-mandate-pence-employment/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ditch its dual mandate}}}\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 keeping employment high and inflation low \u8211\'20\'13 to focus solely on reducing inflation. He has also advocated for cutting social security benefits.\par \par \uc2 Foreign\par \par \uc2 policy: Pence has advocated for continued US aid to Ukraine and met with \uc2 Volodymyr Zelenskiy\uc2  during a surprise visit in June.\par \par \uc2 Immigration: He has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehill.com/blogs/blog-briefing-room/3988961-pence-blasts-biden-on-the-border-ahead-of-title-42-expiration-a-storm-is-coming/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 blasted}}}\uc2  the Biden administration\u8217\'20\'19s immigration policy, describing a \u8220\'20\'1Cstampede\u8221\'20\'1D from Central and South America, and has vowed to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehill.com/homenews/campaign/4039787-pence-says-he-would-not-revive-family-separations-at-border-if-elected/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 finish the border wall}}}\uc2  that began under Trump.\par \par \uc2 Jan\par \par \uc2 uary 6: Pence has campaigned heavily on his refusal to aid Trump in his effort to stop the certification of electoral results and has repeatedly condemned his ex-boss for his role in the Capitol attack.\par \par \uc2 ***\par \par \uc2 Doug Burgum\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 : Burgum {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://abcnews.go.com/Politics/doug-burgum-backed-abortion-ban-north-dakota-outlaw/story?id=99943781"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 signed a law}}}\uc2  banning nearly all abortions in North Dakota but said he would not support a national ban.\par \par \uc2 Economy: The governor of North Dakota, who is also a wealthy businessman, has touted North Dakota\u8217\'20\'19s record as an energy-producing state and said he would prioritize growing the country\u8217\'20\'19s tech and energy sectors.\par \par \uc2 Foreign\par \par \uc2 policy: Winning the \u8220\'20\'1Ccold war with China\u8221\'20\'1D is a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2023/07/09/doug-burgum-cold-war-china-00105314"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 key pillar}}}\uc2  of Burgum\u8217\'20\'19s message to voters.\par \par \uc2 Immigration: Burgum said {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.desmoinesregister.com/story/news/elections/presidential/caucus/2023/07/29/doug-burgum-says-texas-razor-wire-buoy-barrier-is-on-biden/70492637007/d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Biden hasn\u8217\'20\'19t done enough}}}\uc2  to secure the US-southern border and supports stricter restrictions on migration.\par \par \uc2 Jan\par \par \uc2 uary 6: Burgum called for a stop to the violence at the Capitol on January 6 but said he thinks it\u8217\'20\'19s time to \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://abcnews.go.com/Politics/trump-primary-opponent-doug-burgum-joe-biden-won/story?id=102044123"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 move on}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 ***\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020230928ej9s0008d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
