\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Traitors\u8217\'20\'19: US military veterans condemn blocking of officer promotions\b0\par\par\uc2 Martin Pengelly in Washington \par \uc2 545 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 September 2023\par 10:06 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Liberal group Vote Vets called out Republican Tommy Tuberville and party leaders for holding up promotions in protest of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 A liberal group representing US military veterans took aim at Tommy Tuberville, the Alabama Republican senator holding up officer promotions in a protest over \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but also at party leaders who have not forced him to stand down, calling them \u8220\'20\'1Ctraitors\u8221\'20\'1D and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qzxR9h0sar0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warning}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CTight lips could sink ships.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Presented in the style of a second world war propaganda film, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qzxR9h0sar0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a short ad}}}\uc2  from Vote Vets bemoans \u8220\'20\'1Can un-American assault on our military\u8221\'20\'1D by a \u8220\'20\'1Cso-called American senator singlehandedly stop[ping] hundreds of military leaders from taking command\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Tuberville, a former college football coach, was elected in 2020. He is now protesting Pentagon policy that allows service members to travel for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  care if it is restricted where they are based, a possibility since the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  removed the federal right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  last year.\par \par \uc2 As a result of Tuberville\u8217\'20\'19s block on Senate-confirmed promotions, more than 300 senior roles are being filled in an acting capacity. Military officials have bemoaned the effects of Tuberville\u8217\'20\'19s blocks on officers\u8217\'20\'19 families and finances.\par \par \uc2 Even the position of chair of the joint chief of staff stands to be affected, when the current occupant, \uc2 Gen Mark Milley\uc2 , steps down at the end of this month.\par \par \uc2 Noting that leadership of the army, navy, air force and marines has already been affected, the Vote Vets ad shows images of leaders of Iran, Russia and North Korea.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDangerous dictators look on with glee as Tuberville does their work for them, hurting American military readiness,\u8221\'20\'1D says the narrator.\par \par \uc2 Switching to footage of \uc2 Mitch McConnell\uc2 , the Republican leader in the \uc2 US Senate\uc2 , the narrator says Tuberville\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1CAmerican comrades are traitors in their silence. Their tight lips could sink ships\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CLoose lips sink ships\u8221\'20\'1D was a phrase {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://time.com/4591841/loose-lips-sink-ships-posters/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 coined during the second world war}}}\uc2 , under the guidance of the US Office of War Information and meant to warn citizens about careless talk that might boost the US\u8217\'20\'19s enemies.\par \par \uc2 The Vote Vets ad concludes by telling McConnell to \u8220\'20\'1Cstop the block on military promotions\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Last week, Tuberville {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://1819news.com/news/item/tuberville-on-criticism-of-military-holds-im-voting-for-the-people-of-alabama"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  1819 News, an Alabama-based news site: \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m voting for the people of Alabama, and I\u8217\'20\'19m going to stand up for what I believe is right when it comes to the right to life and a lot of the things that go along with it.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The senator has said he will end his protest if the Senate votes on Pentagon \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy. He has also said Democrats who control the Senate can confirm the held-up promotions one by one.\par \par \uc2 As that would be enormously time consuming, the Senate\u8217\'20\'19s Democratic majority leader, \uc2 Chuck Schumer\uc2 , has said it will not happen.\par \par \uc2 Tuberville has rejected criticism based on his own lack of service, saying he is the son of a father who served.\par \par \uc2 On Monday, he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/SenTuberville/status/1703846200967831714"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wished}}}\uc2  a \u8220\'20\'1Chappy 76th birthday to the \uc2 US air force\uc2 \u8221\'20\'1D and thanked the \u8220\'20\'1Cbrave men and women who keep our skies and country safe\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 One user {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/SenTuberville/status/1703846200967831714"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shot back}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CHow about letting them get promoted!! That would be a nice birthday gift!!\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020230920ej9k0018x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
