\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 First Thing: A deal with Putin won\u8217\'20\'19t bring peace, says Ukraine ex-minister\b0\par\par\uc2 Vivian Ho \par \uc2 990 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 September 2023\par 11:31 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Former defence minister \uc2 Oleksii Reznikov\uc2  tells west that Moscow\u8217\'20\'19s goal is \u8216\'20\'18the destruction of Ukrainian statehood\u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 Good morning.\par \par \uc2 Ukraine\u8217\'20\'19s former defence minister is warning his western counterparts that any deal with the Kremlin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/sep/08/goal-destruction-ukraine-ex-defence-minister-warns-west-putin-aim"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 will not end the war}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRussia does not recognise the existence of Ukraine and the Ukrainian people; its goal is the destruction of Ukrainian statehood and the assimilation of Ukrainians,\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 Oleksii Reznikov\uc2  wrote in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2023/sep/08/ukraine-defence-minister-allies-victory-military-oleksii-reznikov"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 piece for the Guardian}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Reznikov resigned on Monday after procurement scandals at the defence ministry, but it is understood that he was not personally involved in any corruption schemes and left because of PR failings.\par \par \uc2 Florida supreme court to hear \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  case that could drastically limit access\par \par \uc2 Today the Florida supreme court {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/sep/08/florida-supreme-court-abortion-case-six-weeks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 will hear arguments}}}\uc2  over the state\u8217\'20\'19s ban on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after 15 weeks of pregnancy.\par \par \uc2 If the state\u8217\'20\'19s high court upholds the 15-week ban, a separate law would take effect prohibiting \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after six weeks \u8211\'20\'13 before most people know they are pregnant.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s been one restriction after another,\u8221\'20\'1D said Dr Kanthi Dhaduvai, a Jacksonville \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  provider with Physicians for Reproductive Health.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 This comes after Mexico\u8217\'20\'19s supreme court ruled that criminalizing abortions\par \par \uc2 was unconstitutional, a ruling with the potential to turn the country into a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/sep/08/mexico-abortion-ruling-americans-border"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 popular destination for Americans}}}\uc2  seeking \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access, as US state \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans proliferate.\par \par \uc2 Tennessee gun reform push ends after legislature adjourns without making any changes\par \par \uc2 Tennessee seemed poised to become the latest state to enact legislation on gun reform, following a deadly shooting at a suburban Nashville school that spurred nationwide attention and grassroots mobilization.\par \par \uc2 Months of protest, advocacy and face-time with the governor {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/sep/08/tennessee-gun-laws-school-shooting-nashville-republican"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ended with no changes}}}\uc2  after the state legislature adjourned a special session late last month. \u8220\'20\'1CIt seems like a game to them, to just gavel in and gavel out,\u8221\'20\'1D said Sarah Neumann, a Covenant school parent who attended every day of the special session to support new firearm and safety laws.\par \par \uc2 In other news \u8230\'20\'26\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 State prosecutors in New Orleans obtained an indictment charging a retired Catholic priest who years ago secretly admitted to church leaders that he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/sep/07/new-orleans-priest-lawrence-hecker-criminal-charges"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sexually molested or harassed numerous children}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Peter Navarro\uc2 , a former White House adviser to \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , was found guilty of contempt of Congress for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/sep/07/navarro-trial-guilty-contempt-congress-trump-adviser-january-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 refusing to cooperate}}}\uc2  with an investigation of the deadly January 6 attack on the US Capitol.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Actor Danny Masterson was sentenced to 30 years to life in prison for the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/sep/07/danny-masterson-that-70s-show-sentenced-prison-rape"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rapes of two women}}}\uc2  two decades ago.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  could soon seek to remove to federal court the Georgia racketeering case charging him with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/sep/07/donald-trump-georgia-election-charges-federal-court"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 attempting to overturn}}}\uc2  the results of the 2020 presidential election in the state.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Atlanta police\uc2  arrested five activists, including two clergy members, after they chained themselves to a bulldozer at the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/sep/07/atlanta-cop-city-arrests"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 construction site for \u8220\'20\'1CCop City\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2 , a huge police and fire department training center being built in a forest south-east of the city.\par \par \uc2 Stat of the day: More than 6,000 of\par \par \uc2 Sudan\u8217\'20\'19s refugees have arrived in Juba, the burgeoning new capital of South Sudan\par \par \uc2 Juba in South Sudan, Africa\u8217\'20\'19s youngest capital, has transformed from a small garrison town into a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/global-development/2023/sep/08/city-of-hope-and-fear-life-in-africas-youngest-capital"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 precarious boomtown}}}\uc2  following an influx of oil money and immigration. Since April, when war broke out in neighboring Sudan, more than 6,000 of the country\u8217\'20\'19s refugees have arrived in Juba.\par \par \uc2 Don\u8217\'20\'19t miss this: Covering up\par \par \uc2 Delhi\u8217\'20\'19s slums\par \par \uc2 before G20\par \par \uc2 With the G20 summit set to kick off in Delhi over the weekend, local authorities have been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/sep/08/ashamed-of-our-presence-delhi-glosses-over-plight-of-poor-as-it-rolls-out-g20-red-carpet"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 removing poor communities from sight}}}\uc2  by erecting tall green barricades and razing over several slums. \u8220\'20\'1CThey have covered our area so that poor people like us, and poverty in the country, is not witnessed by the people arriving from abroad,\u8221\'20\'1D said Saroaj Devi, 50. \u8220\'20\'1CWhen it is election time, every politician comes to see us. They eat with us and make promises. But today, they are ashamed of our presence.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8230\'20\'26 or this: The millions spent to expand New York law enforcement\u8217\'20\'19s capabilities to track and analyze social media posts\par \par \uc2 Documents obtained by a privacy advocacy non-profit found that New York law enforcement agencies have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/sep/08/new-york-police-tracking-voyager-labs-meta-contract"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spent millions of dollars}}}\uc2  to expand their capabilities to track and analyze social media posts and contracted with a surveillance firm accused of improperly scraping social media platforms for data.\par \par \uc2 Climate check: The drought threatening more disasters in Canada\par \par \uc2 Following a series of record-breaking wildfires in British Columbia, officials are warning that an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/sep/07/canada-british-columbia-drought-wildfire-flood"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 unprecedented drought }}}\uc2  in the Canadian province could usher in a fresh set of natural disasters, including flooding, in the coming months.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe consequences of the drought can be profound for many communities and individuals,\u8221\'20\'1D Bowinn Ma, British Columbia\u8217\'20\'19s emergency management minister, told reporters. \u8220\'20\'1CI want to emphasize how significant the drought is that British Columbia is facing right now. It is unlike any kind of drought conditions the province has ever faced, and in my opinion, truly is a sleeping giant of a natural disaster that we are challenged with right now. The impacts will be very, very real.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Last Thing: The quirky librarian aesthetic\par \par \uc2 The new hot trend among Gen Z? Glasses chains. What used to be visual shorthand for elderly women, spinsters or nerds is now hip, with members of Gen Z claiming glasses chains as their own. \u8221\'20\'1DI always get compliments from people around my age or in the gen Z category,\u8221\'20\'1D said De\u8217\'20\'19Siree Fairley, a 28-year-old elementary school teacher from Virginia. \u8220\'20\'1CI believe they admire aesthetics like dark academia and cottagecore, and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/fashion/2023/sep/08/glasses-chain-gen-z-fashion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 glasses chains add to that whimsy.}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Sign up\par \par \uc2 First Thing is delivered to thousands of inboxes every weekday. If you\u8217\'20\'19re not already signed up, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/info/2018/sep/17/guardian-us-morning-briefing-sign-up-to-stay-informed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 subscribe now}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Get in touch\par \par \uc2 If you have any questions or comments about any of our newsletters please email {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:newsletters@theguardian.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 newsletters@theguardian.com}}}\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020230908ej98000xj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
