\par\par \uc2 World news\par \b \uc2 Florida supreme court to hear  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  case that could drastically limit access\b0\par\par\uc2 Ava Sasani \par \uc2 597 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 September 2023\par 11:22 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 If state\u8217\'20\'19s highest court upholds the 15-week ban, a separate, stricter law would take effect prohibiting \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after six weeks\par \par \uc2 The Florida supreme court on Friday will hear arguments in a case that could drastically limit \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access in the south-eastern United States.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers in Florida filed a lawsuit to block the state\u8217\'20\'19s ban on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after 15 weeks of pregnancy.\par \par \uc2 If the state\u8217\'20\'19s high court upholds the 15-week ban, a separate, stricter law would take effect prohibiting \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after six weeks, before most people know they are pregnant.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt would be devastating for providers to have to turn even more folks away under a six-week ban,\u8221\'20\'1D said Whitney White, a staff attorney with the \uc2 ACLU\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Reproductive Freedom Project. \u8220\'20\'1CThey\u8217\'20\'19re already having to turn away patients under the current 15-week ban.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Friday\u8217\'20\'19s hearing is the culmination of Republican efforts to end Florida\u8217\'20\'19s legacy as a safe haven for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  seekers in neighboring states. Five of the seven justices on the current state supreme court were selected by the conservative governor, \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2 , fueling the concerns of Floridians who support \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access.\par \par \uc2 After signing the six-week trigger ban into effect in April, Governor DeSantis said in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.flgov.com/2023/04/13/governor-ron-desantis-signs-heartbeat-protection-act/#:~:text=%E2%80%94%20Today%2C%20Governor%20Ron%20DeSantis%20signed,%2C%E2%80%9D%20said%20Governor%20Ron%20DeSantis."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 brief statement }}}\uc2  that he was \u8220\'20\'1Cproud to support life and family in the state of Florida\u8221\'20\'1D. The Florida governor has been hesitant to discuss \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the campaign trial.\par \par \uc2 A whopping 62% of American adults believe abortions should be legal in \u8220\'20\'1Call or most cases\u8221\'20\'1D, according to a 2022 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.pewresearch.org/politics/2022/07/06/majority-of-public-disapproves-of-supreme-courts-decision-to-overturn-roe-v-wade/#americans-views-of-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2  published by \uc2 Pew Research Center\uc2 . A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ipsos.com/sites/default/files/ct/news/documents/2020-11/topline_reuters_florida_state_poll_w6_11_02_2020_.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 2020 Ipsos/Reuters poll}}}\uc2  found that 56% of likely voters in Florida believe \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  should be legal in most cases. And \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights supporters in Florida say the bans violate the explicit privacy protections found in the state constitution.\par \par \uc2 Despite DeSantis\u8217\'20\'19s conservative overhaul of the state\u8217\'20\'19s high court, White remained confident about the case in the run-up to Friday\u8217\'20\'19s hearing.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CNo justice of the Florida supreme court has ever written a decision questioning the conclusion that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights are protected by the privacy clause,\u8221\'20\'1D White said.\par \par \uc2 Florida Republicans passed the 15-week ban on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in April 2022, months before the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  ended the federal right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . That same month, a judge revived a 2015 state law that mandated patients wait 24 hours between getting an initial consultation for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and undergoing the procedure.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s been one restriction after another,\u8221\'20\'1D said Dr Kanthi Dhaduvai, a Jacksonville \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  provider with Physicians for Reproductive Health.\par \par \uc2 Dhaduvai felt \u8220\'20\'1Cnervous and frustrated\u8221\'20\'1D about the hearing, fearing a court ruling that would make it impossible for her patients to receive \u8220\'20\'1Cwhat is often life-saving care\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Roughly half of Dhaduvai\u8217\'20\'19s patients come to Florida from states like Georgia, Louisiana, Mississippi, Alabama \u8211\'20\'13 even Texas.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI think a lot of people are not aware as to how dangerous this could be, not just for Florida, but the entire region,\u8221\'20\'1D she said. \u8220\'20\'1CFlorida has been a huge access point for people, we already have people traveling these great distances to get care.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In the months after the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  overturned Roe v Wade, Florida saw the greatest increase in the number of legal abortions performed per month, according to a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://societyfp.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/WeCountReport_April2023Release.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2  released this April from the Society of Family Planning.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m still providing care and I\u8217\'20\'19m going to continue providing care, within legal limits, even after the decision,\u8221\'20\'1D Dhaduvai said.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020230908ej9800105\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
