\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Biden attacks \u8216\'20\'18ridiculous\u8217\'20\'19 Republican senator for blocking military picks\b0\par\par\uc2 Martin Pengelly in Washington \par \uc2 738 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 July 2023\par 18:06 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 President says Tommy Tuberville is jeopardising national security with protest against defense department\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy\par \par \uc2 The Alabama Republican senator Tommy Tuberville is jeopardising US national security by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/mar/29/military-politicised-republican-delaying-nominees-abortion-tuberville-austin-schumer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 blocking}}}\uc2  military leadership confirmations in protest of Pentagon policy on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  and the US defense secretary, \uc2 Lloyd Austin\uc2 , said on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 Speaking to reporters in Finland, where he attended meetings after the Nato summit in Lithuania, Biden {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CNNPolitics/status/1679516540641656832"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  he would talk to Tuberville if he thought there was any prospect he would change his \u8220\'20\'1Cridiculous\u8221\'20\'1D position.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHe\u8217\'20\'19s jeopardising US security by what he\u8217\'20\'19s doing,\u8221\'20\'1D the president {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CNNPolitics/status/1679516540641656832"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CI expect the Republican party to stand up \u8211\'20\'13 stand up \u8211\'20\'13 and do something about it. It\u8217\'20\'19s in their power to do that \u8230\'20\'26 they\u8217\'20\'19ve got to stand up and be counted. That\u8217\'20\'19s how it ends.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The conservative-dominated \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  removed the federal right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  last year. Tuberville, a former football coach now a supporter of \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  on the far right of the Republican party, mounted his obstruction effort {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/mar/29/military-politicised-republican-delaying-nominees-abortion-tuberville-austin-schumer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 earlier this year}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 He is seeking the end of \uc2 Department of Defense\uc2  policy that provides paid time off and covers travel costs for servicewomen and dependents in need of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  services.\par \par \uc2 The effect of Tuberville\u8217\'20\'19s block became strikingly evident this week, when the \uc2 US Marine Corps\uc2  found itself {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/jul/10/us-marines-david-berger-republican-abortion-protest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 without a permanent commander}}}\uc2  for the first time in 164 years, since before the civil war.\par \par \uc2 The Pentagon has said more than 650 leadership positions could be vacant by the end of the year.\par \par \uc2 Biden\u8217\'20\'19s secretary of defense, the retired army general \uc2 Lloyd Austin\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2023/07/13/politics/lloyd-austin-tommy-tuberville/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told CNN}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CThis is a national security issue. It\u8217\'20\'19s a readiness issue. And we shouldn\u8217\'20\'19t kid ourselves, I think any member of the Senate armed services committee knows that.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Austin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2023/07/13/politics/lloyd-austin-tommy-tuberville/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CI don\u8217\'20\'19t have an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy, I have an access to non-covered reproductive healthcare policy \u8230\'20\'26 and I think that\u8217\'20\'19s an important policy.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COne in five of my troops \u8230\'20\'26 is a woman and our women provide tremendous value to this force, and I think we need to do everything we can to take care of them.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Earlier this week, Gen Charles Brown Jr, \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s nominee for chairman of the joint chiefs of staff, told a congressional committee: \u8220\'20\'1CWe will lose talent because of these challenges.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Brown\u8217\'20\'19s own confirmation could be held up. The current chair of the joint chiefs, \uc2 Gen Mark Milley\uc2 , is due to step down in October.\par \par \uc2 In Finland, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CNNPolitics/status/1679516540641656832"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Biden said}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CThe idea that we don\u8217\'20\'19t have a chairman of the joint chiefs of staff, the idea that we have all these promotions that are in abeyance right now \u8230\'20\'26 the idea that we\u8217\'20\'19re injecting into fundamental foreign policy decisions what is in fact a debate on social policy issues, is bizarre \u8230\'20\'26 it\u8217\'20\'19s totally irresponsible, in my view.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Tuberville is also under fire for having shown {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/may/11/tommy-tuberville-republican-senator-white-nationalists-us-military"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reluctance to denounce}}}\uc2  white nationalism, a position which this week prompted the author Steven King {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/politics/2023/07/13/tommy-tuberville-white-nationalism-racism/70408946007/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 to say}}}\uc2  the senator \u8220\'20\'1Cgives new meaning to the word idiot\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Like Austin, Gen Brown is African American. Austin told CNN Brown was \u8220\'20\'1Cselected by the president not solely because he is African American. He is a really, really good officer and a great fighter pilot \u8230\'20\'26 I think he\u8217\'20\'19s the right guy at the right time for this job.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Tuberville has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2023/07/12/biden-versus-tommy-tuberville-fundraising-00105786"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told Politico}}}\uc2  his objection to the Pentagon policy is \u8220\'20\'1Cnot just about \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8221\'20\'1D but \u8220\'20\'1Cabout dictating from the White House. Being a dictator, we don\u8217\'20\'19t need dictators. You can\u8217\'20\'19t dictate a law, it\u8217\'20\'19s supposed to go through us.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2023/07/12/biden-versus-tommy-tuberville-fundraising-00105786"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 According to Politico}}}\uc2 , Biden sees Tuberville as a profitable campaign-trail target, calling Tuberville \u8220\'20\'1Cthe former football coach from Alabama, who was a better coach than he\u8217\'20\'19s a senator\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Tuberville {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2023/07/12/biden-versus-tommy-tuberville-fundraising-00105786"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told Politico}}}\uc2  Biden \u8220\'20\'1Cwas a better senator than a president\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 John Wahl, chair of the Alabama Republican party, told the same site Tuberville\u8217\'20\'19s Pentagon protest \u8220\'20\'1Cdoes not hurt him at all\u8221\'20\'1D politically and is \u8220\'20\'1Cgood representation for the people of Alabama and it\u8217\'20\'19s the right policy for any senator\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The Democratic Virginia congresswoman \uc2 Abigail Spanberger\uc2 , a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://spanberger.house.gov/biography"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 former CIA case officer}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=08XBKE5Z9DQ"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told MSNBC}}}\uc2 , Tuberville\u8217\'20\'19s protest was \u8220\'20\'1Cirresponsible\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s outrageous and it needs to stop,\u8221\'20\'1D Spanberger said. \u8220\'20\'1CIt is dangerous to our nation, and to our readiness.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020230713ej7d001xi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
