\par\par \uc2 World news\par \b \uc2 Revealed: Christian legal non-profit funds US anti-LGBTQ+ and anti- \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  organizations\b0\par\par\uc2 Adam Gabbatt \par \uc2 1,465 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 June 2023\par 15:41 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Alliance Defending Freedom\uc2  distributes hundreds of thousands of dollars to fringe groups attacking trans, gay and \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights\par \par \uc2 A rightwing Christian \u8220\'20\'1Chate group\u8221\'20\'1D which is behind a host of legal efforts to roll back \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights, remove LGBTQ+ protections and demonize trans people has seen a huge increase in its funding and has funneled some of that money to a slew of smaller anti-LGBTQ+ and anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  groups across the US, the Guardian can reveal.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/jun/19/alliance-defending-freedom-lgbtq-rights-america"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Alliance Defending Freedom}}}\uc2  (\uc2 ADF\uc2 ), a registered non-profit behind the ongoing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.msnbc.com/deadline-white-house/deadline-legal-blog/neil-gorsuch-303-creative-supreme-court-rcna91471"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 303 Creative supreme court case}}}\uc2  which could chip away at LGBTQ+ rights, saw its revenue surge by more than $25m between 2020 and 2021, a period in which a rightwing obsession with transgender rights and sexual orientation saw almost 200 anti-LGBTQ+ bills {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/nbc-out/out-politics-and-policy/nearly-240-anti-lgbtq-bills-filed-2022-far-targeting-trans-people-rcna20418"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 introduced}}}\uc2  in states around the US.\par \par \uc2 The surge in funding to the \uc2 ADF\uc2 , which has been termed an \u8220\'20\'1Canti-LGBTQ hate group\u8221\'20\'1D by the \uc2 Southern Poverty Law Center\uc2 , saw it record revenue of $104.5m in 2021, according to filings with the \uc2 Internal Revenue Service\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 It has handed over hundreds of thousands of dollars of that newfound wealth to fringe organizations which have sought to diminish the rights of trans students in schools and the right for trans people to participate in sports, an investigation by the watchdog group {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://accountable.us/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Accountable.US}}}\uc2  has found.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 ADF\uc2 , which was founded in 1994 by a group of \u8220\'20\'1Cleaders in the Christian community\u8221\'20\'1D, according to its website, has also given money to groups involved in efforts to ban books which address LGBTQ+ topics, and to organizations which seek to ban \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 It comes as Republican politicians and commentators continue to wage a culture war in the US. In June the \uc2 Human Rights Campaign (HRC)\uc2 , the country\u8217\'20\'19s largest LGBTQ+ advocacy group, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.hrc.org/press-releases/for-the-first-time-ever-human-rights-campaign-officially-declares-state-of-emergency-for-lgbtq-americans-issues-national-warning-and-guidebook-to-ensure-safety-for-lgbtq-residents-and-travelers"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 declared}}}\uc2  a \u8220\'20\'1Cstate of emergency\u8221\'20\'1D for LGBTQ+ people in the US, citing \u8220\'20\'1Can unprecedented and dangerous spike in anti-LGBTQ+ legislative assaults sweeping state houses this year\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 An {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hrc-prod-requests.s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/Anti-LGBTQ-Legislation-Impact-Report.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HRC report}}}\uc2  this month found that 75 anti-LGBTQ+ bills were signed into law in the first five months of 2023 \u8211\'20\'13 more than double the entire amount passed in 2022.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Alliance Defending Freedom\uc2  is a recognized anti-LGBTQ hate group working to build a movement of far-right legal groups to force a dangerous, unpopular agenda on Americans,\u8221\'20\'1D said Kyle Herrig, president of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://accountable.us/#!"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Accountable.US}}}\uc2 , a progressive organization which researches the finances and activities of special interest groups.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Alliance Defending Freedom\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s goal is to strip Americans of their rights and undermine democracy\par \par \uc2 Kyle Herrig of Accountable.US\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CFrom \uc2 ADF\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s involvement with a supreme court case contesting critical LGBTQ rights to the hundreds of thousands of dollars in funding \uc2 ADF\uc2  has granted to anti-democratic organizations, \uc2 ADF\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s goal is to strip Americans of their rights and undermine democracy.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 ADF\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s most high-profile current case is the lawsuit {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.aclu.org/cases/303-creative-inc-v-elenis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 303 Creative, Inc v Elenis}}}\uc2 , which the supreme court decided on Friday.\par \par \uc2 The plaintiff, 303 Creative, is a website design company. 303 Creative has never made wedding websites, but its owner, Lorie Smith, claimed her first amendment rights were infringed because, if she were to start making wedding websites, she would not want to make them for same-sex couples \u8211\'20\'13 which would violate Colorado\u8217\'20\'19s anti-discrimination laws. The court found in 303\u8217\'20\'19s favor.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 ADF\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s rightwing advocacy extends further, however, as the organization has donated to more than a dozen anti-LGBTQ+ and anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  groups.\par \par \uc2 Accountable.US found that the \uc2 ADF\uc2  donated $85,000 to the Child and Parental Rights Campaign, a group which, according to a Politico report, helped Florida Republicans shape the state\u8217\'20\'19s so-called {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/apr/19/florida-education-board-approves-expansion-dont-say-gay-bill"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1Cdon\u8217\'20\'19t say gay\u8221\'20\'1D law}}}\uc2 , which prohibits discussion of sexual orientation and gender identity in schools.\par \par \uc2 The group has also sued two school districts in Florida over issues relating to the rights of trans youth. One case saw the Child and Parental Rights Campaign sue the Leon county school district, complaining that teachers had allowed a child to choose their preferred pronouns. The case was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://flarecord.com/stories/639057568-federal-judge-dismisses-gender-identity-lawsuit-brought-by-parents-against-florida-school-district"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dismissed}}}\uc2  by a judge in January.\par \par \uc2 The Women\u8217\'20\'19s Liberation Front (WLF), a group which previously campaigned against the Obama administration providing protections for transgender students in schools, received $50,000 from the \uc2 ADF\uc2  the same year.\par \par \uc2 A self-described \u8220\'20\'1Cradical feminist\u8221\'20\'1D organization, the WLF has been called an \u8220\'20\'1Canti-trans hate group\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://glaad.org/newsweek-cnn-new-york-times-receive-failing-grades-glaads-report-card-equality-act-coverage/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 by Glaad}}}\uc2 , an LGBTQ+ advocacy group, and appears to have developed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://womensliberationfront.org/womens-sports"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a specific focus}}}\uc2  on restricting trans children\u8217\'20\'19s access to sports.\par \par \uc2 The WLF has partnered with rightwing organizations as it has attempted, and sometimes succeeded, to restrict trans people\u8217\'20\'19s rights in the US. Members of the group have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/dc-md-va/2020/02/07/radical-feminists-conservatives-transgender-rights/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 testified}}}\uc2  in support of legislation which restricts transgender treatments for youth in South Dakota, and have criticized Biden\u8217\'20\'19s executive orders on gender identity.\par \par \uc2 Another beneficiary of the \uc2 ADF\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s largesse was the Kriegshauser Ney Law Group, which in 2022 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2022/09/01/us/kansas-teacher-suspend-settle/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 brought a lawsuit}}}\uc2 , with the \uc2 ADF\uc2 , on behalf of a Kansas teacher who refused to use transgender or non-binary students\u8217\'20\'19 preferred pronouns. The Geary county school district {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/education/2022/09/01/kansas-teacher-wins-school-trans-student-fight/7962956001/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 settled}}}\uc2  with the teacher for $95,000.\par \par \uc2 The Ethics and Public Policy Center, which filed an amicus brief supporting the \uc2 ADF\uc2  in the 303 Creative case, received $78,000. \uc2 Leonard Leo\uc2 , an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/jun/23/concord-fund-republican-attorneys-general"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 influential rightwing activist}}}\uc2  who helped \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  select three supreme court justices, serves as a director for the group, which has also supported a case which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/may/17/abortion-pill-ruling-mifepristone-fifth-circuit-supreme-court-explained"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 challenges FDA approval}}}\uc2  of the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill mifepristone.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Alliance Defending Freedom\uc2  and groups like it have grown thanks to a dark influence network of far-right funders,\u8221\'20\'1D Herrig said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIn order to rein in these extremist groups, the key conservative players making up this network must be exposed for what they\u8217\'20\'19re really doing: pushing an anti-democratic agenda to make sure they personally benefit.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Groups like this will burn bright for a time like this, but when demography catches up we will see them fizzle out\par \par \uc2 Justin Unga\uc2  of the \uc2 Human Rights Campaign\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 ADF\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s work comes amid a wave of anti-LGBTQ+ legislation and rightwing demonization of trans people. Over 220 bills which \u8220\'20\'1Cspecifically target transgender and non-binary people\u8221\'20\'1D were introduced in the first four and a half months of 2023, the \uc2 Human Rights Campaign{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.hrc.org/press-releases/weekly-roundup-of-anti-lgbtq-legislation-advancing-in-states-across-the-country-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 found}}}\uc2 , with Florida, North Dakota, Tennessee and Texas showing a particular relish for legislation which would affect trans rights.\par \par \uc2 At the national level, trans people are also under attack from the right. As the Republican presidential primary gears up, opposition to LGBTQ rights \u8211\'20\'13 and trans rights in particular \u8211\'20\'13 has become something of a litmus test for candidates, as they seek to win over a far-right GOP base.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Alliance Defending Freedom\uc2  is among the largest and most effective legal advocacy organizations dedicated to protecting the religious freedom and free speech rights of all Americans. Our record includes 14 supreme court victories since 2011 and over 400 victories protecting the free speech rights of students on college campuses,\u8221\'20\'1D said Jeremy Tedesco, senior vice-president of corporate engagement at the \uc2 ADF\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Justin Unga\uc2 , vice-president of strategic initiatives at the \uc2 Human Rights Campaign\uc2 , described the \uc2 ADF\uc2  as \u8220\'20\'1Cone of the most dangerous elements in the anti-LGBTQ+ cause\u8221\'20\'1D, but said the group\u8217\'20\'19s influence would not last forever.\par \par \uc2 In 2022, the \uc2 Pew Research Center{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.npr.org/2022/09/15/1123289466/americas-christian-majority-is-shrinking-and-could-dip-below-50-by-2070#:~:text=America's%20Christian%20majority%20is%20shrinking,below%2050%25%20by%202070%20%3A%20NPR&text=Tiny%20Desk-,America's%20Christian%20majority%20is%20shrinking%2C%20and%20could%20dip%20below%2050,of%20Americans%20identify%20as%20Christian."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 found}}}\uc2  that only 64% of Americans identified as Christian, down from 90% 50 years prior, and predicted that the number of Christians in the US would fall below 50% in the next 40 years.\par \par \uc2 The number of Americans who identify as LGBTQ+, meanwhile, is \u8220\'20\'1Csurging dramatically, and will be an impact in future elections\u8221\'20\'1D, Unga said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C[Groups like the \uc2 ADF\uc2 ] will burn bright for a time like this, but when public opinion catches up, when demography catches up, we will see them fizzle out,\u8221\'20\'1D he said.\par \par \uc2 In the meantime, Unga said the \uc2 Human Rights Campaign\uc2  and other groups are engaged in efforts to highlight politicians\u8217\'20\'19 record on LGBTQ+ rights, and to turn out the vote in key areas.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAll elected officials are still beholden to their constituents and the people they serve, the people who elect them,\u8221\'20\'1D Unga said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19ve identified over 60 million what we call \u8216\'20\'18equality voters\u8217\'20\'19: voters who are motivated by issues of equality. They are people who pay attention to whether or not the candidate or elected official votes to advance protections for LGBTQ+ folks or votes to oppose them.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 He added: \u8220\'20\'1CWe will turn our voters out in support of our candidates and we intend to do that at every level of government from state legislatures to the White House.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020230630ej6u000xf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
